*.db-shm
.DS_Store
dist/*
# …except the shipped CLI bundle. `bun install -g github:hookdump/overton`
# cannot build it: a global install has no workspace, so `@overton/*` does not
# resolve at install time. The artifact has to be in the tree for a git install
# to work at all. Rebuild with `bun run build` and commit it when releasing.
!dist/overton.js
*.log
.overton/
